cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  HydroPhysicsAI: GPU physics-informed neural operators for
  groundwater, benchmarked against per-well gray-box ODEs
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata
  from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Abdoul Rachid
    family-names: Ouedraogo
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Rekin226/HydroPhysicsAI'
url: 'https://github.com/Rekin226/HydroPhysicsAI'
abstract: >-
  A single GPU-trained, physics-informed neural operator across
  many groundwater monitoring wells, conditioned on each well's
  static attributes and benchmarked in free-running simulation
  mode against per-well calibrated gray-box ODEs. Includes a
  probabilistic forecaster, an NVIDIA PhysicsNeMo port, and an
  interactive demo.
keywords:
  - scientific-machine-learning
  - physics-informed-neural-networks
  - neural-operator
  - groundwater
  - hydrology
  - pytorch
  - physicsnemo
